      "zh": {
        "title": "愛爾蘭航空改裝10架A330 首度導入豪華經濟艙",
        "summary": "愛爾蘭航空計畫在2027年10月讓首架改裝機投入都柏林至紐約甘迺迪機場的部分航班。",
        "body": [
          "愛爾蘭航空（Aer Lingus）11月18日宣布改裝10架空中巴士A330-300長程客機。改裝後將首度增設豪華經濟艙，並同步更新商務艙及經濟艙。",
          "首架改裝機預計2027年10月1日投入部分都柏林往返紐約甘迺迪國際機場的EI104、EI105航班。航空公司計畫隨改裝進度，將新客艙擴展至其他北美航線。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Aer Lingus to introduce premium economy on ten Airbus A330s",
        "summary": "The first refitted aircraft is expected to serve selected Dublin–New York JFK flights from October 2027.",
        "body": [
          "Aer Lingus announced on November 18 that it will add premium economy for the first time as it refits ten Airbus A330-300s. The project will also update business and economy cabins.",
          "The first refitted jet is expected to enter service on October 1, 2027, on selected Dublin–New York JFK flights EI104 and EI105. Aer Lingus plans to extend the new cabins to other North American routes as it refits more aircraft."
        ]
